{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["安慰耶路撒冷的话"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你们这追求公义、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻求耶和华的，当听我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要追想被凿而出的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被挖而出的岩穴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要追想你们的祖宗亚伯拉罕","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和生养你们的撒拉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为亚伯拉罕独自一人的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我选召他，赐福与他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他人数增多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经安慰锡安","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和锡安一切的荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使旷野像伊甸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠像耶和华的园囿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在其中必有欢喜、快乐、感谢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和歌唱的声音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我的百姓啊，要向我留心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的国民哪，要向我侧耳；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为训诲必从我而出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必坚定我的公理为万民之光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公义临近；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩发出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的膀臂要审判万民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海岛都要等候我，倚赖我的膀臂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要向天举目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"观看下地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为天必像烟云消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必如衣服渐渐旧了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其上的居民也要如此死亡","poem":1},{"noteId":52},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我的救恩永远长存；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公义也不废掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道公义、将我训诲存在心中的民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要怕人的辱骂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要因人的毁谤惊惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为蛀虫必咬他们，好像咬衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虫子必咬他们，如同咬羊绒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我的公义永远长存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩直到万代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华的膀臂啊，兴起！兴起！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以能力为衣穿上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像古时的年日、上古的世代兴起一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从前砍碎拉哈伯、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺透大鱼的，不是你吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使海与深渊的水干涸、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使海的深处变为赎民经过之路的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是你吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华救赎的民必归回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌唱来到锡安；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永乐必归到他们的头上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必得着欢喜快乐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忧愁叹息尽都逃避。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"惟有我，是安慰你们的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是谁，竟怕那必死的人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怕那要变如草的世人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却忘记铺张诸天、立定地基、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"创造你的耶和华？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因欺压者图谋毁灭要发的暴怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整天害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实那欺压者的暴怒在哪里呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被掳去的快得释放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不死而下坑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的食物也不致缺乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华—你的 神—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搅动大海，使海中的波浪匉訇—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我将我的话传给你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的手影遮蔽你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为要栽定诸天，立定地基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又对锡安说：你是我的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷苦难的终结"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，兴起！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兴起！站起来！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从耶和华手中喝了他忿怒之杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝了那使人东倒西歪的爵，以致喝尽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所生育的诸子中，没有一个引导她的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所养大的诸子中，没有一个搀扶她的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒凉、毁灭、饥荒、刀兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这几样临到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁为你举哀？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我如何能安慰你呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的众子发昏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各市口上躺卧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像黄羊在网罗之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都满了耶和华的忿怒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"—你 神的斥责。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你这困苦却非因酒而醉的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的主耶和华—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是为他百姓辨屈的 神如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我已将那使人东倒西歪的杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我忿怒的爵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从你手中接过来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不致再喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"我必将这杯递在苦待你的人手中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们曾对你说：你屈身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由我们践踏过去吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你便以背为地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像街市，任人经过。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":52,"caller":"-","text":"如此死亡：或译像蠓虫死亡","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}